  m_Name: Dlg_Teach_OS_02_BiosSetup
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSequence
  lines:
  - speakerName: Guide
    text: The boot order decides which device the firmware tries first. To install
      from your flash drive the USB must be Boot Option #1 - and once Windows is
      installed you put the SSD back on top, or the PC keeps restarting into the
      installer.
